{"id":"172745cffd3cdc97","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-embedding-theorems.md","title":"Embedding Theorems","display":"thm-embedding-theorems — Embedding Theorems","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-embedding-theorems","aliases":["72-thm-embedding-theorems"],"display":"thm-embedding-theorems — Embedding Theorems","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §3.1.4 print66–67/PDF78–79","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; translation recursion total; full proof not independently reproduced","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-embedding-theorems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-embedding-theorems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-embedding-theorems — Embedding Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §3.1.4 print66–67/PDF78–79"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; translation recursion total; full proof not independently reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-embedding-theorems-—-Embedding-theorems\">thm-embedding-theorems — Embedding-theorems</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限五元带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 遍历原子公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim A\">\\(\\sim A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\bot\">\\(A\\to\\bot\\)</span>（区别于本地原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> 节点）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^N\">\\(A^N\\)</span> 是以下有限结构递归产生的公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP^N&amp;:=\\sim\\sim P,\\quad\\bot^N:=\\bot,\\quad\\top^N:=\\top,\\quad(\\neg A)^N:=\\sim A^N,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^N&amp;:=A^N\\land B^N,\\quad(A\\to B)^N:=A^N\\to B^N,\\\\\n(A\\lor B)^N&amp;:=\\sim(\\sim A^N\\land\\sim B^N),\\quad(\\forall xA)^N:=\\forall xA^N,\\quad(\\exists xA)^N:=\\sim\\forall x\\sim A^N.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP^N&amp;:=\\sim\\sim P,\\quad\\bot^N:=\\bot,\\quad\\top^N:=\\top,\\quad(\\neg A)^N:=\\sim A^N,\\\\\n(A\\land B)^N&amp;:=A^N\\land B^N,\\quad(A\\to B)^N:=A^N\\to B^N,\\\\\n(A\\lor B)^N&amp;:=\\sim(\\sim A^N\\land\\sim B^N),\\quad(\\forall xA)^N:=\\forall xA^N,\\quad(\\exists xA)^N:=\\sim\\forall x\\sim A^N.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma\\vdash(\\langle\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\rangle)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\vdash(\\langle\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A^N\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma\\vdash(\\langle\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A\\rangle)\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\vdash(\\langle\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle A^N\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐旧翻译缺失的原始¬和⊤分支；反向来自经典等价与LJ包含于经典逻辑。翻译结果使用→⊥式否定，不把58的经典宏翻译当作直觉主义语法同一。源定理§3.1.4陈述双向；本地递归在有限语法树上唯一，未复写整个证明归纳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-embedding-theorems-—-Embedding-theorems","text":"thm-embedding-theorems — Embedding-theorems","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"r